      "content": "it just feels so lonely. like i'm stuck in this half-life where i'm still here but i don't really belong anywhere. people keep saying \"it gets better\" but they don't get it. they didn't lose their other half. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever will. it's like i'm just a shadow of what i used to be when we were together.",
